		"description": "<p>The [[/ref actor.name]] magically takes the shape of a humanoid or beast or changes back into its true form. It reverts to its true form if it dies. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying is absorbed or borne by the new form ([[/ref actor.name]]’s choice). In the new form, the [[/ref actor.name]]’s stats are unchanged except for its size. It can’t use Y except in Z form. In X form, it can attack only with its bite and claws, if appropriate to its form. If the X form is Large or smaller, the reach of these attacks is reduced to 5 feet. In X form, it can attack only with its weapon.</p>",
